{"ref":"BDB, אֱלִיהוּ","hw":"אֱלִיהוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיהוּ</span></big>  <a data-ref=\"Job 32:4\" href=\"/Job.32.4\">Jb 32:4</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיהוּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 32:2\" href=\"/Job.32.2\">Jb 32:2</a> + 6 times; <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>He is</em> (<em>my</em>) <em>God</em><strong>) </strong><br><strong>a.</strong>  the young friend of Job <a data-ref=\"Job 32:2\" href=\"/Job.32.2\">Jb 32:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 32:4\" href=\"/Job.32.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 32:5\" href=\"/Job.32.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 32:6\" href=\"/Job.32.6\">6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 34:1\" href=\"/Job.34.1\">34:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 35:1\" href=\"/Job.35.1\">35:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 36:1\" href=\"/Job.36.1\">36:1</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  an Ephraimite, Samuel’s great-grandfather <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.1\">1 S 1:1</a> cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אֱלִיאָב\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אֱלִיאָב\">אֱלִיאָב</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.12\">1 Ch 6:12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיאֵל</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.19\">19</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  chief of Manasseh <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.20\">1 Ch 12:20</a>.<br><strong>d.</strong>  a Korahite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.7\">1 Ch 26:7</a>.<br><strong>e.</strong>  one of the brethren of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.18\">1 Ch 27:18</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֱלִיאָב\" href=\"/BDB,_אֱלִיאָב\", dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיאָב</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.6\">1 S 16:6</a>).","next":"BDB, אֶלְיַחְבָּא","prev":"BDB, אֵלִיָּה"}